<title>USA: Brilliant Digital cuts IPO price range.</title>
<headline>Brilliant Digital cuts IPO price range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brilliant Digital Entertainment Inc's initial public offering of two million shares is expected to be priced Thursday night at $6.00 per share of common stock, said C.S. First Boston.</p>
<p>The estimated price was reduced to $6.00 from a range of $11.50 to $13.50 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
